\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Residual connection}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{transformer}

\p{If #{F} maps hidden-state sequences to hidden-state sequences of the same
shape, its \newvocab{residual connection} is the map
##{
\operatorname{Res}_F(H)=H+F(H).
}}

\p{The Transformer uses residual connections around its attention and
feed-forward sublayers in \citet{sec. 3.1}{vaswani2017attention}. The summands
must have the same type. A residual connection specifies the additive route;
it does not specify where normalization is applied.}
